## Semantics
- drag chi cong don trong Session; move_mutations tra Mutation::Placement -> mot buoc undo
- copy_mutations tra Mutation::Insert voi ObjectId moi
- AffineGesture::update chi preview; cancel tra scene ve nguyen trang, khong dung undo/redo; prepare -> PreparedTransaction

